  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Tan Bi Ya’s talk in Ni Yu blessed land places him among that year’s popular candidates for the Imperial Court contest in Northern Plains, with Supreme Elder Ye Lui Lai behind the Immortal Gu loan.",
      "chapters": [
        514
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tan_bi_ya",
        "loc_ni_yu_blessed_land",
        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_ye_lui_lai",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With that Immortal Gu and rank five peak stage fire path strength, he dominates Du Jiao region before a seven-army alliance presses Ye Lui army.",
      "chapters": [
        525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-and-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_du_jiao_region"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later contest summary has him kill three rank five Gu Masters when Ye Lui army defeats that alliance, then take Yang tribe, lose to Ma tribe, and escape with remnant troops to submit to Hei tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-and-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "fac_yang_tribe",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that loss he remains Ye Lui tribe’s current tribe leader while serving under Hei tribe, and he still owns a fire path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        584
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-and-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_ye_lui_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Hei Lou Lan share the same status as leaders of peer super tribes backed by Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        604
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-and-hei-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Imperial Court blessed land he is a rank five peak stage expert whose fire path subdues wood path Gu worms, with a fire path support type Immortal Gu on him.",
      "chapters": [
        595
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That Gu was lent by Ye Lui Lai before the contest and sits near his heart; when Eighty-Eight True Yang Building trembles, the Immortal Gu trembles with it.",
      "chapters": [
        564
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Formless hands later seize the Gu worms of his group, including that lent fire path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        633
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-path-immortal-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan’s strength path phantoms break the mortal side’s final defense and Hei Lou Lan cannot reinforce in time, Ye Lui Sang and the others are killed one after another by those phantoms.",
      "chapters": [
        648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-true-yang-building",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
